WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.110
Get back here!

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.120
André!!

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.540
André!

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.000
Oscar!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.790
Hurry, André!

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.850
The Royal Guards are going
to storm the assembly hall!

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.800
We have to stop them at all costs!

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.960
<i>On June 23, 1789, the representatives
in favor of the National Assembly,</i>

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:46.040
<i>ignored the order of the French King,
Louis XVI to dissolve,</i>

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:50.220
<i>and staged a sit-in at the Estates-General assembly hall.</i>

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:57.690
<i>The French Guards Company B, led by Oscar,
was ordered to forcefully remove them.</i>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.730
<i>However, Oscar refused the order.</i>

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.080
<i>Also, 12 guardsmen including Alain,
who sided with Oscar,</i>

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.260
<i>refused the order and were arrested.</i>

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.940
<i>Now, Oscar is racing towards the assembly
hall of the Estates-General...</i>

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:25.060
<i>...to stop the Royal Guards, who have been ordered to
storm the assembly hall, instead of the French Guards.</i>

